                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Unplayable.\n\nStuck on Main Menu regardless of what I do.\n\nClick New Game, return to Menu\nClick Continue... Return to Main Menu....\n\n[Above is regular review]\n\nDeveloper has attended to my issue with the utmost urgency and haste of which is rare and certainly appreciated. \n\nUpon playing, I can say the wait was well worth the time and patience. \n\nI will have to agree with most reviews that claim the game to be \"hard\" as it is; but to those with TD knowledge this proves just a challenge. And an enjoyable one at that.",
